#### 10. Ignored / Disabled Test — `disabledTest()` (line 109)

```java
@Disabled("flaky, fix later")
@Test
void disabledTest() { ... }
```

The reason `"flaky, fix later"` has no tracking reference. Disabled tests accumulate indefinitely.

**Refactor:** Either fix the flakiness and re-enable, or link to a tracking issue:

```java
@Disabled("Tracked by #1234 — flaky due to race in event listener")
```

**Risk if unfixed:** Dead test that silently rots; the flakiness root cause is never addressed.

